  monsterId: 1aa0f517fbae4f1fbe4b5a12e8e67244
  displayName: Harpy
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 93e87a5e32ced7a449465ffd5e68e8ef, type: 3}
  description: "Harpies are medium-sized hybrid creatures, roughly human-sized but
    clearly avian, with a visible tail of a bird and two wings that fold tightly
    when they perch. They move at a normal pace when grounded but rely on flight
    for ambush and escape. Their voices are entirely animalistic - warbling shrieks
    and birdlike cries - rather than words, even if they seem to \u201Cmock\u201D
    with sound."
